\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Kernel density estimate of name lengths (characters) for students and their guardians, showing the range of free-form string lengths present in the corpus. Names are synthetic substitutes matched to the originals in length and character class (Section~\ref {sec:ethics}), so the length distribution is faithful to the original although the character content is not.}}{6}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:namelen}{{6}{6}{Kernel density estimate of name lengths (characters) for students and their guardians, showing the range of free-form string lengths present in the corpus. Names are synthetic substitutes matched to the originals in length and character class (Section~\ref {sec:ethics}), so the length distribution is faithful to the original although the character content is not}{figure.6}{}}
